    historicalQuestions:["What can Assyrian records reveal about Hosea's political world?","How does the fall of Samaria shape the book's rhetoric?","How should the marriage imagery be interpreted as prophetic symbolism?","What is the relationship between Hosea's northern focus and later Judahite transmission?"],
